# --- Build output -----------------------------------------------------------
bin/
inter/

# Release libraries are NOT shipped. Debug libs are committed (see below) so
# students never compile dependencies in a lab; anyone who wants Release
# reloads the external projects and builds them, which republishes here.
**/lib/Release/
**/lib/Dist/

# --- Visual Studio state ----------------------------------------------------
# We DO commit the .suo, because it carries the unloaded state of the external
# projects: students should see them already unloaded on first open.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so a bare
# ".vs/" plus "!.vs/engine/v18/.suo" silently does nothing - which is why the
# old rule only ever worked via "git add -f". Each level has to be unwound
# explicitly instead.
#
# NOTE: v18 is Visual Studio 2026. If the IDE version changes, add the new
# directory here or the .suo stops being tracked - with no error to warn you.
.vs/*
!.vs/engine/
.vs/engine/*
!.vs/engine/v18/
.vs/engine/v18/*
!.vs/engine/v18/.suo

# --- Generated project files ------------------------------------------------
# engine.sln and the .vcxproj files ARE tracked, deliberately.
#
# They are generated by premake, so tracking them means a merge of an engine
# change into the lesson branches conflicts in build output. maintain.py
# --propagate resolves that automatically by regenerating: a conflict between
# two derived files has no meaningful manual resolution anyway.
#
# They were briefly untracked to avoid those conflicts, which was worse. git
# checkout then stopped updating them, so they lingered listing the previous
# branch's sources and the next build failed naming files from another lesson.
# Avoiding that needed a post-checkout hook and per-machine git config that
# does not travel with a clone.
#
# Tracking them also means students can unzip and double-click engine.sln, as
# they always have, with no .bat step first.
#
# Never hand-edit them - premake overwrites on every run. Edit premake5.lua.
*.vcxproj.user

# --- Misc -------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aps
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
ipch/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
